     nnppppppdd..ccoonnff — NPPP daemon configuration file

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     nnppppppdd..ccoonnff is the configuration file for the PPP daemon npppd(8).

     nnppppppdd..ccoonnff is divided into the following main sections:

           _G_l_o_b_a_l             Global settings.
           _T_u_n_n_e_l             Tunneling protocol and PPP settings.
           _I_P_C_P               Internet Protocol Configuration Protocol (IPCP)
                              of PPP.
           _I_n_t_e_r_f_a_c_e          Interface settings.
           _A_u_t_h_e_n_t_i_c_a_t_i_o_n     Authentication settings.
           _B_i_n_d               Bind settings.
           _R_A_D_I_U_S             RADIUS settings.

