     _n_a_m_e specifies the name of this iippccpp setting.  The maximum number of iippccpp
     settings is 8.

     The supported options are as follows:

     ppooooll--aaddddrreessss _a_d_d_r_e_s_s_-_r_a_n_g_e | _a_d_d_r_e_s_s_-_m_a_s_k [ffoorr _d_y_n_a_m_i_c | _s_t_a_t_i_c]
