             192.168.0.2-192.168.0.254) or _a_d_d_r_e_s_s_-_m_a_s_k (e.g. 192.168.0.0/24).
             _d_y_n_a_m_i_c means the address space is reserved for dynamic alloca‐
             tion; _s_t_a_t_i_c means the address space is reserved for static allo‐
